      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-gothru-rag-36",
      "display_title": "Issue #36: feat: Support AI Chat Analytics - Usage Trend API & Intent Normalization",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Support accounts require aggregated analytics to evaluate user queries, trends over time, and user intent patterns without inspecting individual private transcripts. The AI Engine (<code class=\"notranslate\">gothru-rag</code>) must supply the missing metrics, a daily usage time-series endpoint, and align user intent classification with product specifications.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Requirements &amp; Scope</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Total Sessions in Overview:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Update <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/overview</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">ChatOverviewStatsResponse</code> to include <code class=\"notranslate\">total_sessions</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">COUNT(DISTINCT session_id) FILTER (WHERE session_id IS NOT NULL)</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Daily Usage Trend API:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/trend</code> (protected by <code class=\"notranslate\">X-Admin-Key</code>) accepting <code class=\"notranslate\">days: int</code> (default 30).</li>\n<li>Return daily aggregated metrics: <code class=\"notranslate\">date</code> (YYYY-MM-DD), <code class=\"notranslate\">total_queries</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">total_sessions</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">action_triggers_count</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Intent Taxonomy Alignment:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Update <code class=\"notranslate\">classify_intent()</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">app/copilot/analytics.py</code> to strictly categorize user intent into: <code class=\"notranslate\">How To</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">Troubleshooting</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">Execute Action</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">Greeting</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">Other</code>.</li>\n<li>Add keyword detection patterns for <code class=\"notranslate\">Troubleshooting</code> (e.g. \"error\", \"failed\", \"issue\", \"stuck\", \"cannot\", \"gagal\", etc.).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Popular Questions Pagination:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add <code class=\"notranslate\">offset: int = 0</code> query parameter support to <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/popular-questions</code> alongside <code class=\"notranslate\">limit</code> to allow table pagination.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Testing:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add and update unit tests in <code class=\"notranslate\">tests/api/test_admin_stats.py</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">total_sessions</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">/stats/trend</code>, and intent normalization.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/overview</code> returns accurate <code class=\"notranslate\">total_sessions</code> count.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/trend</code> returns ordered daily points without gaps in date ranges.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Intent distribution accurately outputs the standard 5 categories.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/popular-questions</code> supports <code class=\"notranslate\">limit</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code> pagination.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> All unit tests pass with 100% green status.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">API Documentation &amp; Response Examples</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">1. <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/overview</code></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Retrieves aggregated copilot usage statistics, total queries, unique sessions, action triggers, and distribution metrics.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Path:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">/stats/overview</code></li>\n<li><strong>Method:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET</code></li>\n<li><strong>Headers:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">X-Admin-Key: &lt;ADMIN_API_KEY&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query Parameters:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">days</code> (integer, optional, default: <code class=\"notranslate\">30</code>): Lookback period in days (<code class=\"notranslate\">1</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">365</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Example Request</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -X GET &quot;http://localhost:8000/stats/overview?days=30&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">curl -X GET <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>http://localhost:8000/stats/overview?days=30<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Response 200 (<code class=\"notranslate\">ChatOverviewStatsResponse</code>)</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;period_days&quot;: 30,\n  &quot;total_queries&quot;: 1420,\n  &quot;total_sessions&quot;: 328,\n  &quot;unique_questions&quot;: 890,\n  &quot;action_triggers_count&quot;: 215,\n  &quot;action_conversion_rate&quot;: 15.14,\n  &quot;feature_distribution&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;feature&quot;: &quot;Edit 360 Images&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 420,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 29.58\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;feature&quot;: &quot;Upload Panoramas&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 310,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 21.83\n    }\n  ],\n  &quot;intent_distribution&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;How To&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 780,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 54.93\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;Troubleshooting&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 320,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 22.54\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;Execute Action&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 215,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 15.14\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;Greeting&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 75,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 5.28\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;Other&quot;,\n      &quot;count&quot;: 30,\n      &quot;percentage&quot;: 2.11\n    }\n  ]\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"period_days\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">30</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_queries\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1420</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_sessions\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">328</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"unique_questions\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">890</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"action_triggers_count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">215</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"action_conversion_rate\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">15.14</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"feature_distribution\"</span>: [\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"feature\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Edit 360 Images<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">420</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">29.58</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"feature\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Upload Panoramas<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">310</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">21.83</span>\n    }\n  ],\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent_distribution\"</span>: [\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>How To<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">780</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">54.93</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Troubleshooting<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">320</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">22.54</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Execute Action<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">215</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">15.14</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Greeting<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">75</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">5.28</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"intent\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Other<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">30</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"percentage\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">2.11</span>\n    }\n  ]\n}</pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">2. <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/trend</code></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Retrieves daily time-series usage statistics of queries, unique sessions, and action triggers.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Path:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">/stats/trend</code></li>\n<li><strong>Method:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET</code></li>\n<li><strong>Headers:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">X-Admin-Key: &lt;ADMIN_API_KEY&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query Parameters:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">days</code> (integer, optional, default: <code class=\"notranslate\">30</code>): Lookback window in days (<code class=\"notranslate\">1</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">365</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Example Request</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -X GET &quot;http://localhost:8000/stats/trend?days=30&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">curl -X GET <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>http://localhost:8000/stats/trend?days=30<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Response 200 (<code class=\"notranslate\">ChatUsageTrendResponse</code>)</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;period_days&quot;: 30,\n  &quot;trend&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-13&quot;,\n      &quot;total_queries&quot;: 45,\n      &quot;total_sessions&quot;: 12,\n      &quot;action_triggers_count&quot;: 8\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14&quot;,\n      &quot;total_queries&quot;: 52,\n      &quot;total_sessions&quot;: 15,\n      &quot;action_triggers_count&quot;: 10\n    }\n  ]\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"period_days\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">30</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"trend\"</span>: [\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"date\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>2026-09-13<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_queries\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">45</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_sessions\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">12</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"action_triggers_count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">8</span>\n    },\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"date\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>2026-09-14<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_queries\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">52</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total_sessions\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">15</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"action_triggers_count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">10</span>\n    }\n  ]\n}</pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">3. <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /stats/popular-questions</code></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Retrieves top frequently asked questions with limit and offset pagination support.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Path:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">/stats/popular-questions</code></li>\n<li><strong>Method:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">GET</code></li>\n<li><strong>Headers:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">X-Admin-Key: &lt;ADMIN_API_KEY&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query Parameters:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">limit</code> (integer, optional, default: <code class=\"notranslate\">20</code>): Maximum number of questions to return (<code class=\"notranslate\">1</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">100</code>).</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code> (integer, optional, default: <code class=\"notranslate\">0</code>): Number of questions to skip for pagination (<code class=\"notranslate\">&gt;= 0</code>).</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">feature</code> (string, optional, default: <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>): Filter questions by feature category.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Example Request</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -X GET &quot;http://localhost:8000/stats/popular-questions?limit=20&amp;offset=0&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">curl -X GET <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>http://localhost:8000/stats/popular-questions?limit=20&amp;offset=0<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>X-Admin-Key: your-admin-api-key<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Response 200 (<code class=\"notranslate\">PopularQuestionsResponse</code>)</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;total&quot;: 45,\n  &quot;offset&quot;: 0,\n  &quot;limit&quot;: 20,\n  &quot;items&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;query_hash&quot;: &quot;a1b2c3d4e5f67890&quot;,\n      &quot;sample_question&quot;: &quot;How to upload panoramas from Google Drive?&quot;,\n      &quot;normalized_query&quot;: &quot;how to upload panoramas from google drive?&quot;,\n      &quot;category_feature&quot;: &quot;Upload Panoramas&quot;,\n      &quot;ask_count&quot;: 128,\n      &quot;last_asked_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-12T08:30:00Z&quot;,\n      &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01T12:00:00Z&quot;\n    }\n  ]\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"total\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">45</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"offset\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"limit\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">20</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"items\"</span>: [\n    {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"query_hash\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>a1b2c3d4e5f67890<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"sample_question\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>How to upload panoramas from Google Drive?<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"normalized_query\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>how to upload panoramas from google drive?<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"category_feature\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Upload Panoramas<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"ask_count\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">128</span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"last_asked_at\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>2026-10-12T08:30:00Z<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"created_at\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>2026-09-01T12:00:00Z<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n    }\n  ]\n}</pre></div>",
